{"id":"wb-7-960","name":"秦峰塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"秦峰塔","text":"秦峰塔是一座七层楼高的古塔，位于江苏省苏州市的县级市昆山市千灯镇的延福寺附近，始建于南朝梁天监二年（503年），别称美人塔。秦峰塔于2013年被选为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，它也是千灯镇的地标性建筑之一和江苏省最早的文物保护单位之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A7%A6%E5%B3%B0%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86785759,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785759","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/916f08fe75c81ad887e2c173.jpg","title":"千灯4A旅游景区.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%83%E7%81%AF4A%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/%E5%8D%83%E7%81%AF4A%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​千灯4A旅游景区","width":320,"height":180}}